  <abstract format="text/plain" language="en" script="Latn">Recommendation ITU-T H.781 defines a detailed functional architecture to provide digital signage (DS) services. The functional architecture consists of DS server, DS client, content delivery server and content delivery client. This Recommendation describes how functions in the architecture interact with each other to provide the services according to general information flows and defines reference points that can be considered in specifying detailed protocols.</abstract>
